# Helm Sports Labs - Cursor Rules

## Quick Reference
Read CLAUDE.md for full context. This file is for quick reminders.

## Stack
Next.js 14 App Router • TypeScript strict • Supabase • Tailwind

## Critical Paths
```
Types:     @/lib/types
Server DB: @/lib/supabase/server (await createClient())
Client DB: @/lib/supabase/client (createClient())
Actions:   src/app/actions/
UI:        src/components/ui/
```

## Design Tokens
```
Primary:    #16A34A (primary-600)
Background: #FFFEFA (cream)
Glass:      bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl border-white/20 rounded-2xl
Shadow:     shadow-glass, hover:shadow-card-hover
Text:       text-warm-900 (primary), text-warm-500 (secondary)
```

## Current Sprint
CoachHelm AI layer for GolfHelm — see CLAUDE.md for types

## Before Committing
- [ ] Types from @/lib/types
- [ ] 'use client' if using hooks
- [ ] No console.log
- [ ] Matches existing patterns
